{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a run-and-gun shooter. Movement is deliberate, enemies hit hard, and staying too long makes the facility more dangerous. Each day sends your crew into abandoned underwater facilities where danger rises the longer you stay. You play as a Fathomwalker pushing deeper through nine increasingly hostile dives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is deliberate, resources are limited, and every decision carries weight. Most dives last between three and ten minutes depending on the day, and success depends on coordination, rationing, and knowing when to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed first and foremost for 1\u20134 player co-op, The Hull is fully playable solo but balanced around teamwork and shared resource management. It delivers a compact, atmospheric survival experience instead of a long campaign or deep buildcraft systems. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/bc583facd8fc6b14003453b7f21b94f0.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span> Facilities are tight, unstable, and hostile. Traversal is slow and methodical, and enemies hit hard. Clearing a room does not guarantee safety because the threat level rises over time and pushes more danger into the facility. The challenge comes from surviving the increasing pressure rather than solving puzzles or exploring large spaces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/c0971084e8b9c280761e7a34bc5364d1.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span>Ammo and healing are intentionally scarce. You cannot craft supplies during a dive, so every shot and every point of health matters. Teams that share resources, avoid unnecessary fights, and stay disciplined have the highest chance of making it back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/c3326145961bfd56c0892ea67f678264.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/c3326145961bfd56c0892ea67f678264.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/c3326145961bfd56c0892ea67f678264.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/5a608e2d6777f7f80b5f05417ede429d.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span>Between dives, you regroup aboard The Hull, a rusted vessel that serves as your lifeline. Here you craft weapons, upgrade your suit, and prepare for the next run. Progression is focused and easy to understand. It emphasizes consistency and power scaling rather than complex build trees or branching systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/b7ba1150092af9eb904f257371925280.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/b7ba1150092af9eb904f257371925280.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/b7ba1150092af9eb904f257371925280.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/b0b497bef111542728db1671a141bdd6.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span>Choose from a curated set of SMGs, rifles, shotguns, and precision weapons. Each one fills a clear role and uses one of three ammo types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/4b5a98b637d763c1d7b961a45bc4277c.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/4b5a98b637d763c1d7b961a45bc4277c.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/4b5a98b637d763c1d7b961a45bc4277c.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/d0ce3ed2ba028cc1f701a4022403c42c.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span>Each dive becomes more dangerous the longer you stay. Deeper levels introduce more aggressive enemies and more unstable environments. The goal is to survive the run, extract what you can, and decide whether to push your luck or escape before the threat level becomes overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/439a186b05468d3e024534bb7063068f.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/439a186b05468d3e024534bb7063068f.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/439a186b05468d3e024534bb7063068f.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/04840c135fa76ae693a46b79fc5db4a08d775c9e.jpg"},{"name":"Second Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/056de0eaaa5532b4c6dc3d4801c4fbeae67f20b4.jpg"},{"name":"Third Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/f751200853c16907de4b0f989f2116ec6c20284a.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/4413fd051a93dad6957c67511dea655a4dab0385.jpg"},{"name":"Fifth Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/7305ecb3bb45013e746f67a47851d8d170d67c1b.jpg"},{"name":"Sixth Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/2a1d9843952c653a41431b98a87b665fc689cc5a.jpg"},{"name":"Seventh Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/e614a765a4fca10d7163d86875985cf7b82a7b1e.jpg"},{"name":"Eighth Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/e5b2eded1701818013d54abf412096256346cd6c.jpg"},{"name":"Final Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/0b62727ef86a875caf7bf5aeee0261f3ef60a61f.jpg"},{"name":"Hullcifer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987150/f0211a2e0408de6bd7665211687e2eed4bc11428.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987150?t=1772778040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987150?t=1772778040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/3661cae52b2e18ea8b3dd5c6776f1130be86bc4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772778040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/3661cae52b2e18ea8b3dd5c6776f1130be86bc4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772778040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a run-and-gun shooter. Movement is deliberate, enemies hit hard, and staying too long makes the facility more dangerous. Each day sends your crew into abandoned underwater facilities where danger rises the longer you stay. You play as a Fathomwalker pushing deeper through nine increasingly hostile dives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is deliberate, resources are limited, and every decision carries weight. Most dives last between three and ten minutes depending on the day, and success depends on coordination, rationing, and knowing when to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed first and foremost for 1\u20134 player co-op, The Hull is fully playable solo but balanced around teamwork and shared resource management. It delivers a compact, atmospheric survival experience instead of a long campaign or deep buildcraft systems. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/bc583facd8fc6b14003453b7f21b94f0.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span> Facilities are tight, unstable, and hostile. Traversal is slow and methodical, and enemies hit hard. Clearing a room does not guarantee safety because the threat level rises over time and pushes more danger into the facility. The challenge comes from surviving the increasing pressure rather than solving puzzles or exploring large spaces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.poster.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.webm?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/a3c04e2679fc1531659517eb0eb4a498.mp4?t=1772778040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987150/extras/c0971084e8b9c280761e7a34bc5364d1.avif?t=1772778040\" width=1560 height=102 /></span>Ammo and healing are intentionally scarce. You cannot craft supplies during a dive, so every shot and every point of health matters. Teams that share resources, avoid unnecessary fights, and stay disciplined have the highest chance of making it back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com